{"w":2400,"h":3406,"lines":[{"y":0.043189639168288108,"h":0.01875460406856122,"c":1,"x":0.86780232208073316,"w":0.093178100585937562,"t":"Reading"},{"y":0.09447674422831831,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"Questions 1-4","c":1,"x":0.059793817607128236,"w":0.15670102437337238},{"t":"Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?","h":0.021831102533614755,"c":1,"w":0.85379282633463538,"x":0.055587550354738842,"y":0.12926610002038774},{"c":1,"y":0.16605746711789349,"t":"In boxes 1-4 on your answer sheet, write","w":0.41687924702962242,"h":0.020510847681911248,"x":0.055459279050783433},{"x":0.13360541946358273,"h":0.014809266301511803,"t":"TRUE","y":0.20524620107323277,"c":1,"w":0.060678679148356118},{"c":1,"y":0.22383720933239581,"x":0.13195876216395525,"w":0.074226805369059234,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"FALSE"},{"h":0.015997760098469094,"c":1,"x":0.2762886641425496,"y":0.2049324722863316,"t":"if the statement agrees with the information","w":0.43711339314778641},{"w":0.43092783610026048,"h":0.014679976512037674,"c":1,"y":0.22372284179228541,"t":"if the statement contradicts the information","x":0.27628865916107787},{"h":0.016954999913626145,"w":0.4640747578938802,"y":0.24035905169526806,"t":"NOT GIVEN if there is no information on this","c":1,"x":0.13188297258835899},{"w":0.64123713175455732,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"t":"There is some doubt about what caused the Mary Rose to sink.","x":0.10309277422513806,"y":0.28919553718009561},{"x":0.05154639712048284,"w":0.75463918050130208,"c":1,"h":0.019083969465648831,"y":0.31532589555493162,"t":"2 The Mary Rose was the only ship to sink in the battle of 19 July 1545."},{"h":0.020374687853380369,"w":0.71363535563151037,"c":1,"y":0.34465096455469069,"x":0.053496178516595494,"t":"3 Most of one side of the Mary Rose lay undamaged under the sea."},{"x":0.05154638755828695,"t":"4 Alexander McKee knew that the wreck would contain many valuable","y":0.37345860239374407,"w":0.73814432779947903,"c":1,"h":0.017615971814445075},{"y":0.39389534899296119,"x":0.10103092591682312,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1,"t":"historical objects.","w":0.17938144683837892},{"c":1,"w":0.15938730875651042,"t":"Questions 5-8","h":0.017740764830718625,"x":0.05538607826344602,"y":0.43850297133403049},{"y":0.47674418621322578,"c":1,"h":0.015988371754420694,"w":0.76907216389973954,"t":"Look at the following statements (Questions 5-8) and the list of dates below.","x":0.051546392153156262},{"c":1,"x":0.053608243910397091,"t":"Match each statement with the correct date, A-G.","w":0.50103093465169268,"y":0.51308139507167072,"h":0.017452956225965877},{"w":0.65360824584960941,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.54932472127916476,"c":1,"t":"Write the correct letter, A-G, in boxes 5-8 on your answer sheet.","x":0.053608247307154119},{"t":"5 A search for the Mary Rose was launched.","x":0.051422337313100808,"h":0.019910820217883041,"c":1,"w":0.47855565388997395,"y":0.58468537592604242},{"x":0.051448356941311696,"h":0.020184163548844114,"t":"6 One person's exploration of the Mary Rose site stopped.","w":0.6208234151204427,"y":0.61279626022480982,"c":1},{"h":0.017615971814445186,"x":0.049484526272312146,"w":0.67216496785481772,"t":"It was agreed that the hull of the Mary Rose should be raised.","c":1,"y":0.64386376978904358},{"x":0.049484536282525346,"w":0.016494844754536941,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.67296511610494225,"t":"8","c":1},{"t":"The site of the Mary Rose was found by chance.","y":0.67293012337307512,"w":0.48865976969401037,"h":0.01614797416324143,"c":1,"x":0.10103093977779651},{"c":1,"t":"A","w":0.018556701342264836,"y":0.75290697667515472,"x":0.34845360800584352,"h":0.014534883616744709},{"c":1,"x":0.34845360832457761,"t":"C","w":0.020618556340535499,"y":0.80959302318678261,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"t":"D","x":0.34845360798866143,"w":0.018556701342264836,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"y":0.83866279053911996},{"t":"List of Dates","y":0.72372284177870883,"x":0.42680412460050587,"w":